{"id":"wb-7-276","name":"徐堡古城址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"徐堡古城址","text":"徐堡古城址，亦称徐堡遗址，位于中国河南省焦作市温县武德镇徐堡村东、沁河南岸，是一处以龙山文化城址为核心的古遗址。龙山城址平面略呈圆角长方形，现存面积约20万平方米，遗迹包括城墙、台地、灰坑、墓葬和陶窑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BE%90%E5%A0%A1%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95081393,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95081393","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4fd2f36c60cb7d03787c59d9.jpg","title":"20261002_Xubu_Ancient_City_Site.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20261002_Xubu_Ancient_City_Site.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/20261002_Xubu_Ancient_City_Site.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南温县 徐堡古城址","width":320,"height":213}}